    <string name="welcome_text"><![CDATA[<p><em>Hello from <a href=\"https://github.com/9001/party-up\">Party UP!</a> <b>version %s</b></em></p><p>This app lets you upload files (images, videos) to a <a href=\"https://github.com/9001/copyparty#quickstart\">copyparty</a> server.</p><hr /><p><b>Use your favorite gallery app to open a picture or video you\'d like to upload, then hit the share button and select \"Party UP!\" 🎉</b></p><p>You can also share things like youtube videos; the app will then upload a message with the link. The copyparty server can be configured to log these for later viewing.</p><p>Funfact: You can run the copyparty server itself on any device where Python is available — and thanks to <a href=\"https://f-droid.org/en/packages/com.termux/\">Termux</a> this also means Android phones :^)</p>]]></string>
    <string name="server_url_help">To upload into a folder, add the folder at the end of the URL.\nFor example: \"https://ask.com/foo/bar/\"\nExample: \"https://ask.com/%Y/%m/\" will create\n\"/Year/month/\" (%Y/%m/%d, %H:%M:%S)</string>
